<refentry xmlns:p="http://www.w3.org/ns/xproc"
          xmlns:e="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Spec/ElementSyntax"
          xmlns:cxerr="http://xmlcalabash.com/ns/error"
          xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
          xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
          xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
          xml:id="cx-pdf-copy">
<?db filename="cx-pdf-copy"?>
<refnamediv>
  <refname>cx:pdf-copy</refname>
  <refpurpose>Creates a copy of the PDF</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<refsection role="introduction">
<title>Introduction</title>
<para>This step creates a copy of the PDF.
</para>
</refsection>

<refsection role="step-declaration">
<title>Step declaration</title>
<xi:include href="../../../../xmlcalabash/src/main/resources/com/xmlcalabash/ext/pdf-steps.xpl"
            xpointer="xpath(/*/*[@type='cx:pdf-copy'])"/>
<?import pdf-steps.xpl?>
</refsection>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>

<para>This step creates a copy of the PDF. If the source PDF is encrypted, this
step decrypts the PDF and removes any access restrictions on it.</para>

<para>The only purpose, really, of this step is to change the
<option>compression</option> used.
</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Document properties</title>

<para>No document properties are preserved.
</para>
</refsection>

</refentry>
